Z||000014||Steve Normington||07-07-2001||06:53 PM||||BTW, Stephens are not welcome here.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>One of the reasons I started using Steve instead of Steven is that no one asks you if you spell Steve with a "ph". Also, the federal government does not like it when you put Steve on your A&P license because that is not your correct name. They actually made me go back and add an "n" to the documents.||||reg||1
